                                "sense_id": "7e50ce89-2983-3343-97b5-c61eb741216b",
                                "text": "\"One is all the more delighted,\" he writes in a note, \"to revel in these postseasonal rarities which have the flavor of a second coming, and a mystery.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e557e710-94f3-4e64-b758-95445d71f115",
                                "sense_id": "7e50ce89-2983-3343-97b5-c61eb741216b",
                                "text": "Nearly every static ideology is likely to advance in one turning per saeculum (when what it offers is preseasonal and useful) and retreat in another (when what it offers is postseasonal and harmful)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c70c83d-2a31-40a6-9472-87aba47b02e2",
                                "sense_id": "7e50ce89-2983-3343-97b5-c61eb741216b",
                                "text": "Otherwise one falls prey to being \"postseasonal,” or on the wrong side of history."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
